<title>ITALY: BOXING-BRITAIN'S REID WINS WBC SUPER-MIDDLE TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-BRITAIN'S REID WINS WBC SUPER-MIDDLE TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Robin Reid won the World Boxing Council (WBC) super-middleweight boxing title on Saturday when he stopped reigning champion Vincenzo Nardiello of Italy in the seventh of 12 scheduled rounds.</p>
</text>
